(7661322, 1248385, 70896, '<td valign="top">I like this photo, but there''s something about it that im having a hard time with. Not sure if its the harsh lighting, or perhaps the tension in the fingers. Perhaps try softening the light? I would have also liked to see a little bit more play with the depth of field and more emphasis on the blue point. Still, interesting shot! :)</td>', 'I like this photo, but there''s something about it that im having a hard time with. Not sure if its the harsh lighting, or perhaps the tension in the fingers. Perhaps try softening the light? I would have also liked to see a little bit more play with the depth of field and more emphasis on the blue point. Still, interesting shot! :)', '2020-05-04 14:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
