(7661937, 1248858, 3306, '<td valign="top">This brought back memories of my childhood. They had books that you would stick the stamps in the proper place for identification. You could buy a whole bag of random stamps and try to find the stamps to fill in the book. I still have first day issue stamps on envelopes commemorating the stamp that my grandfather gave me in the 60s! Thanks for the memories. Well done composition.</td>', 'This brought back memories of my childhood. They had books that you would stick the stamps in the proper place for identification. You could buy a whole bag of random stamps and try to find the stamps to fill in the book. I still have first day issue stamps on envelopes commemorating the stamp that my grandfather gave me in the 60s! Thanks for the memories. Well done composition.', '2020-05-09 07:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7661938, 1248867, 3306, '<td valign="top">You do beautiful work. Love the cat!</td>', 'You do beautiful work. Love the cat!', '2020-05-09 07:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7661939, 1248510, 3306, '<td valign="top">Ill have to suggest this to my wife. She has taken up baking during the pandemic. Im the sampler. Ive gained 10 lbs! Chocolate chip, oatmeal, sugar, cream cheese cookies. Lemon cake, pistachio cake, brownies, cup cakes!! I hope you have given your recipe:) I like your picture. I would love to try one, but Im eating a cookie at the moment!</td>', 'Ill have to suggest this to my wife. She has taken up baking during the pandemic. Im the sampler. Ive gained 10 lbs! Chocolate chip, oatmeal, sugar, cream cheese cookies. Lemon cake, pistachio cake, brownies, cup cakes!! I hope you have given your recipe:) I like your picture. I would love to try one, but Im eating a cookie at the moment!', '2020-05-09 07:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7661940, 1248790, 3306, '<td valign="top">Beautiful dog. I love the ear flip! He looks like a pup. Good shot!</td>', 'Beautiful dog. I love the ear flip! He looks like a pup. Good shot!', '2020-05-09 07:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7661941, 1248845, 3306, '<td valign="top">Ive watched some videos on this. It looks like fun. Messy though! Ill have to try it sometime. I like the colors and your abstract pattern.</td>', 'Ive watched some videos on this. It looks like fun. Messy though! Ill have to try it sometime. I like the colors and your abstract pattern.', '2020-05-09 07:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7661942, 1248851, 3306, '<td valign="top">You must have been running on air. They look pristine!  I used to run a lot. 10 Ks and 1/2 marathons. Always wanted to run a marathon but didnt have the time to train.i envy you. Hard on the knees and back. Now I walk the golf course!. Good shot. I like your setup and that you only sowed what you needed to to get your message across.</td>', 'You must have been running on air. They look pristine!  I used to run a lot. 10 Ks and 1/2 marathons. Always wanted to run a marathon but didnt have the time to train.i envy you. Hard on the knees and back. Now I walk the golf course!. Good shot. I like your setup and that you only sowed what you needed to to get your message across.', '2020-05-09 07:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7661943, 1248860, 3306, '<td valign="top">I never was good at crosswords. I envy you. Good shot!</td>', 'I never was good at crosswords. I envy you. Good shot!', '2020-05-09 07:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7661944, 1248786, 3306, '<td valign="top">I envy your musical ability. I played the trumpet in the school band. They switched me to the baritone for the marching band because I was the only one strong enough to carry it!  Tried playing the guitar but couldnt get past  Louie, Louie! You must have had fun setting this up. Good shot.</td>', 'I envy your musical ability. I played the trumpet in the school band. They switched me to the baritone for the marching band because I was the only one strong enough to carry it!  Tried playing the guitar but couldnt get past  Louie, Louie! You must have had fun setting this up. Good shot.', '2020-05-09 07:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7661945, 1248815, 3306, '<td valign="top">Wow, that looks delicious! Beautifully represented.</td>', 'Wow, that looks delicious! Beautifully represented.', '2020-05-09 07:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7661947, 1248383, 3306, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful picture and  a wonderfully compassionate hobby.</td>', 'What a beautiful picture and  a wonderfully compassionate hobby.', '2020-05-09 07:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7661949, 1248671, 3306, '<td valign="top">What a great skill and wonderful hobby that will be enduring for generations. I wish you had taken the picture at a different angle and in total focus to show the entire subject that represents your talent.</td>', 'What a great skill and wonderful hobby that will be enduring for generations. I wish you had taken the picture at a different angle and in total focus to show the entire subject that represents your talent.', '2020-05-09 07:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7661950, 1248816, 3306, '<td valign="top">Looks like a cool hobby but what are you trying to represent? It doesnt give me any idea of the technique or what you are making.</td>', 'Looks like a cool hobby but what are you trying to represent? It doesnt give me any idea of the technique or what you are making.', '2020-05-09 07:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7661951, 1248817, 3306, '<td valign="top">Im guessing this is you, Jeb! I would have loved seeing you sitting in the drivers seat of your MG. Did you sell that beautiful TR3?</td>', 'Im guessing this is you, Jeb! I would have loved seeing you sitting in the drivers seat of your MG. Did you sell that beautiful TR3?', '2020-05-09 07:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7661952, 1248847, 3306, '<td valign="top">Cute! I think he is watching you!</td>', 'Cute! I think he is watching you!', '2020-05-09 07:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7661953, 1248872, 3306, '<td valign="top">Very creative idea! I love that the view is through an eyeball and the title perfectly compliments the picture.</td>', 'Very creative idea! I love that the view is through an eyeball and the title perfectly compliments the picture.', '2020-05-09 07:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7661954, 1248772, 3306, '<td valign="top">Youve done it again Roz. Magnificent!</td>', 'Youve done it again Roz. Magnificent!', '2020-05-09 07:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7661955, 1248879, 3306, '<td valign="top">Funny! I like that you are in the picture as opposed to just taking a picture of yarn. It gives your composition personality!</td>', 'Funny! I like that you are in the picture as opposed to just taking a picture of yarn. It gives your composition personality!', '2020-05-09 07:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7661957, 1248448, 3306, '<td valign="top">Looks like fun and very calming.</td>', 'Looks like fun and very calming.', '2020-05-09 08:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7661958, 1248776, 3306, '<td valign="top">You must have seen this coming!</td>', 'You must have seen this coming!', '2020-05-09 08:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7661959, 1248706, 3306, '<td valign="top">I like the idea but I think you could have displayed your hobby better. Its supposed to be fun and yet you have represented it as a dark, mechanical, a necessary labor. If you love your hobby then it would show better in color with a beautiful cloth pattern and maybe even your hands at work holding the cloth as you quilt. Just my opinion!</td>', 'I like the idea but I think you could have displayed your hobby better. Its supposed to be fun and yet you have represented it as a dark, mechanical, a necessary labor. If you love your hobby then it would show better in color with a beautiful cloth pattern and maybe even your hands at work holding the cloth as you quilt. Just my opinion!', '2020-05-09 08:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7661960, 1248877, 3306, '<td valign="top">Cool shadow from above.</td>', 'Cool shadow from above.', '2020-05-09 08:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7661961, 1248871, 3306, '<td valign="top">That is very beautiful. You are quite talented. Good representation of your hobby.</td>', 'That is very beautiful. You are quite talented. Good representation of your hobby.', '2020-05-09 08:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
