(7662285, 1248510, 251422, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by GolferDDS:</b></div><hr/><i> Ill have to suggest this to my wife. She has taken up baking during the pandemic. Im the sampler. Ive gained 10 lbs! Chocolate chip, oatmeal, sugar, cream cheese cookies. Lemon cake, pistachio cake, brownies, cup cakes!! I hope you have given your recipe:) I like your picture. I would love to try one, but Im eating a cookie at the moment! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I know - seems like baking an eating is a favorite pastime during the pandemic.  I always try and look for heathy alternatives to at least rationalize the cookies...PM me and I can give you the recipe.</td>', 'Originally posted by GolferDDS: Ill have to suggest this to my wife. She has taken up baking during the pandemic. Im the sampler. Ive gained 10 lbs! Chocolate chip, oatmeal, sugar, cream cheese cookies. Lemon cake, pistachio cake, brownies, cup cakes!! I hope you have given your recipe:) I like your picture. I would love to try one, but Im eating a cookie at the moment!   I know - seems like baking an eating is a favorite pastime during the pandemic.  I always try and look for heathy alternatives to at least rationalize the cookies...PM me and I can give you the recipe.', '2020-05-11 11:08:31.000000', NULL, 0),
