(7662359, 1248790, 67145, '<td valign="top">what a great shot .. and with an insect .. my two loves represented so excellently .. lol .. ;)<br/>you may not have gone amazing in the challenge .. but in real life this would have to be a total winner .. <br/>and congratulations on the birth of your ''babies'' .. no wonder you have been run off your feet so to speak .. <br/>the size of your dogs .. just overwhelming .. i could fit many toddy''s into one of your irish wolfhounds .. <br/>but dogs .. whether large or small are such wonderful souls who grace our lives .. :)<br/></td>', 'what a great shot .. and with an insect .. my two loves represented so excellently .. lol .. ;)you may not have gone amazing in the challenge .. but in real life this would have to be a total winner .. and congratulations on the birth of your ''babies'' .. no wonder you have been run off your feet so to speak .. the size of your dogs .. just overwhelming .. i could fit many toddy''s into one of your irish wolfhounds .. but dogs .. whether large or small are such wonderful souls who grace our lives .. :)', '2020-05-11 22:32:14.000000', NULL, 0),
