(7662369, 1248869, 28742, '<td valign="top">Gotta hand it to ya, Lev, you got a lottery balls to pull off this masterful deception. :P. Congratulations!</td>', 'Gotta hand it to ya, Lev, you got a lottery balls to pull off this masterful deception. :P. Congratulations!', '2020-05-12 02:07:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(7662376, 1248772, 98565, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by primabarbara:</b></div><hr/><i> Roz - huge Congrats! <br/>I''m looking for a hat as dinner right now... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Ohh your comment makes me want to explain it...<br/> <br/>In German, if we are quite sure something is going to happen, we say: Ich fresse einen Besen wenn.." which literally means: "I''ll eat a broom, if..."<br/>But I was pretty sure noboy would understand that so I was looking on an internet site for English idioms what might have a similar meaning and I got the suggestion: "I''ll eat my hat if..."<br/>Since I predicted a <b>blue </b>in my first comment during voting but your picture ended up with a <b>yellow </b> ribbon I felt obliged to say in a funny way that my prediciton didn''t come true and now I should make my announcement (eating my hat) come true. That''s it.</td>', 'Originally posted by primabarbara: Roz - huge Congrats! I''m looking for a hat as dinner right now...   Ohh your comment makes me want to explain it... In German, if we are quite sure something is going to happen, we say: Ich fresse einen Besen wenn.." which literally means: "I''ll eat a broom, if..."But I was pretty sure noboy would understand that so I was looking on an internet site for English idioms what might have a similar meaning and I got the suggestion: "I''ll eat my hat if..."Since I predicted a blue in my first comment during voting but your picture ended up with a yellow  ribbon I felt obliged to say in a funny way that my prediciton didn''t come true and now I should make my announcement (eating my hat) come true. That''s it.', '2020-05-12 05:21:25.000000', NULL, 0),
